You could smell your enemy's scent everywhere. Your acute beastly hearing detected some noise coming from the room on the second floor. You silently ran up the stairs and took a peek through a slightly opened door. It was him! The culprit of your misery.  You instantly felt a burst of rage. Your eyes became bloodshot. You could not control yourself any longer, you broke into the room with a loud growling. When you took enough pleasure seeing your enemy trembling with fear, you floored him. The last thing he was able to do, was to make a horrible scream before you bit through his throat.
You waited till morning, then found a pair of trousers, a shirt, some boots, dressed up and went back home. Unfortunately, the next night you transformed in the werewolf again.